window.products.push({"id":763042,"name":"Deluxe Star Eco-Friendly Tea Kettle for stove top 3.17 Quart Stone Finish Food grade Stainless Steel Teapot, Anti-Hot Handle, Anti-Rust, Shiny Finish,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MKmgBCknS._AC_SL1052_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY ANTI- RUST & FOOD- GRADE MATERIAL- We use professional certified food grade stainless steel to ensure that it is resistant to rust & corrosion and easily heats up. ECO- FRIENDLY AND DURABLE! Stainless Steel has proved to be highly environmentally friendly. This is because primary energy is used sparingly Non-renewable sources are saved and the waste stream is limited. There is about 60 percent recycled content inside every stainless steel piece. AUDIBLE AND LOUD WHISTLING & EASY TOUCH BUTTON- the SMART WHISTLE goes off when water boils and is loud enough to be heard even under noisy conditions. The button conveniently located on the handle makes open and close very easy and safe, avoiding burns or spills. FAST & SAFE- This tea kettle is designed to optimize heat conduction with a broad 8 ¾ inch CAPSULE BOTTOM and to maximize the efficiency of boiling; our lid provides a 100% seal. You in control: The spout can stay open until you close it. HEAT RESISTANT HANDLE! The especially coated handle helps you to grab the tea kettle safely, without getting burns, with a bare hand. CONTEMPORARY DESIGN & LARGE CAPACITY- Designed with you in mind, this stylish tea kettle will add a stylish touch to your room and have high performance at the same time. Ultra-resistant and modern finish, ergonomic handle, broad bottom, large capacity. Extremely durable, it is all you need to prepare tea or help you every time you need to boil water. 3.17 quarts equals 3 liters or 13 cups! Great Mother’s Day and Christmas gift!SUITABLE FOR ALL KINDS OF STOVE & EASY TO CLEAN- This premium stainless steel Tea Kettle is suitable for any heat source including gas, electric, induction, etc. Quick and easy to clean, will look like new for years and years! BUY WITH CONFIDENCE! Our Tea Kettles are rigorously tested to ensure the highest performance, safety and durability","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MKmgBCknS._AC_SL1052_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deluxe Star","source_asin":"B0941YM8XY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763042","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0941YM8XY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0941YM8XY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
