window.products.push({"id":763088,"name":"WEBI Coat Hook Wall Mounted - Heavy Duty Metal Dual Wall Hook Rack – Double Prong Robe Hooks for Bathroom Kitchen Office Entryway Closet,Single Hook,B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UpTfmXpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand: WEBI Name: WEBI Decorative Dual Coat Hook Material: Constructed from premium steel. Dimensions: Overall Size:You can refer to the product images above. Package Includes: 5 * Webi coat hooks, screws, plastic expansion anchor, washer and cap WEBI RAIL HOOK FEATURES Contemporary  Rust-resist Heavy duty Decorative  Wall Mounted / wood door mounted  Easy installed APPLICATION WEBI metal hook can be used as clothes rail hook, hat hook, hand towel hook, dish towel hook, bath towel holder, scarf hanger, or as a wall hook to hold your purse, keys, bags, belts and stuffes. It is a great choice as a moden decor adding to your bathroom, entryway, kitchen, bedroom, closet, office or hotel. How to install: (1) Align the base on the wall and then mark the midpoint of the holes on the wall with pencil. (2) Drill holes in the spot(s) where you've marked, be sure that you hold the drill perpendicular to the wall so that the anchor will sit parallel to the ground (3) Slide the plastic expansion anchor into the wall, If needed, tap the anchor with a hammer (4) Line up the base and put the bolt washers through the screw, Insert the hook screw into the plastic anchor and start to turn clockwise (5) Install the screws caps on the head of screws. COMPANY - WEBI is a company specialized in research, development, manufacture, and marketing of architectural hardware for almost 10 years. Supplying not only hardware of high quality, but also professional technicial customer services, Webi has achieved a good reputation in construction industry. So do not hesitate to buy, and do not hesitate to contact our customer service if any problem. Webi will back you up.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UpTfmXpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WEBI","source_asin":"B01MR4KOV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MR4KOV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MR4KOV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":763089,"name":"LEVERLOC Cube Vacuum Storage Space Saver Sealed Bags 6 Premium Packs, No Pumps Needed, 80% Space Saving for Clothes Comforters Pillows Beddings Blanke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150AYPJfCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Larger Capacity & Money Savings ] Innovative three-dimensional design makes one same size cube bag equals to four flat bags. Items, like clothes, pillows, comforters, blankets etc., can be easily stored upright and vacuumed down to a roughly box-ish shape, thus it looks neater than flat bags. Save more space and money, store more items and neater with Leverloc cube vacuum storage bags. [ No Pump Needed & Easier to use ] 2 in 1 unique valve technology keeps you away from using pump that laborious, may occupy your space and lose easily. Just vacuum bags easier by sitting a or by any regular vacuum cleaner. [ Airtight & No Leak Design ] Patent valve, ergonomic designed clips and visual color changeable zipper makes air compression and perfect sealing faster and easier. Never worry about leak. [ Premium Material & Perfect Protection ] Leverloc cube vacuum storage bags are made of premium high-molecular PA/PE material. Durable and reusable. Protect your clothes from water, dust and odors. [ 100% Satisfaction Customer Service ] Package includes 6 packs cube vacuum space saver storage bags (4 jumbo packs - 31x40x15 inches, 2 large packs - 31x22x12 inch). Please feel free to contact us if you have any problem with Leverloc items. We'll help solve it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7150AYPJfCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEVERLOC","source_asin":"B091YC8CW2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091YC8CW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091YC8CW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
