window.products.push({"id":763311,"name":"Sprouting Kit,Seed Sprouting Jar Kit,2Pcs Large Wide Mouth Mason Jar with 304 Stainless Steel Screen Sprout Lid,Sprout Jar Stand,Tray,Blackout Sleeves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sakwd3GiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Seed Sprouting Jar Kit】2Pcs mason sprouting jars,2Pcs 304 stainless steel screen sprout lids,2Pcs sprouting jar blackout Sleeves,1Pcs sprouting jar Brush,1Pcs sprouting jar Stand,1Pcs sprouting jar Tray.The seed sprouting kit includes all the parts you need to grow most sprouts at home! Harvest your own fresher and tastier sprouts without having to perform too many complicated operations. 【More Perfect Sprouting Kit】Considering the preference of different plants for light, we matched blackout sleeves for sprouting kit. Most green leafy sprouts prefer bright sunlight,while beans, soy products, and grain sprouts actually prefer darker environments.This sprouting jar kit is great for making seed sprouted vegetables, Such as broccoli seeds, mung bean, and so on.At the same time, we also match the canning brush in the set,which can be cleaned after use. 【Instructions For Use】First: Please put the seeds you need to sprout into a sprouting jar, then pour in some water and let them soak for 4-8 hours. Second: Pour the water out of the sprouting jar, then place the sprouting jar with the seeds to be sprouted on a stand so that it has enough sunlight. Third: Rinse the sprouts with water 1-2 times a day. Fourth: After 3-7 days in this way, you can get the sprouts you want 【Interesting and Happiness】Growing your own bean sprouts and other vegetables at home is fresher and more delicious! Among other things, sprouts providing thing that few vegetables can provide. Also, the process of growing sprouts is fun, and children can participate in the entire process of growing. From small sprout seeds to mature sprouts, children can witness its growth in just a few days.You'll love this sprouting kit! 【High Quality and Practical-Sprouting Kit】The sprouting jar lids and stand are made of rust-proof 304 stainless steel, sturdy and durable, not easy to rust. The sprouting jar blackout sleeves are made of durable cloth, washable and reusable. where the stainless steel stand provides slope for the Mason jar and the tray is high enough to collect the water and avoid creating a mess on your countertop. 【Service Guarantee】To prevent damage to the seed sprouting jar kit set during shipping, we use pearl cotton foam packaging. If you find any damage or dissatisfaction after receiving the sprouting jar, please contact us in time and we will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sakwd3GiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boombamo","source_asin":"B0BT99ZKD8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT99ZKD8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT99ZKD8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
