window.products.push({"id":763442,"name":"Zanza DIY Graffiti Bee Partern Pillow Case Coloring Nylon Decorative Cushion Cover Square 18\" 45cm45cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HsKaoCWsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Zanza Graffiti pillowcase has a very beautiful and elegant pattern , you can give full play to your imagination to fill in your favorite color.Create your Secret Garden with Zanza's Magic Pen. The pillow/cushion cover is made of 100% high quality Nylon. For best results, fix colors by ironing.Colors are washable(warm) or dry-cleanable once fixed. Invisible zipper improves the appearance and provides easy insertion and removal. Size: 18 x 18 inches / 45 cm x 45 cm.CUSHION COVER ONLY, NO PILLOW INSERT. Use it as a gift worded by yourself,perfect for multiple occasions: Birthday gifts,Christmas, Wedding gifts etc. Liners feature a special quality point for fine and medium lines.Colors may be air cured for at least 24 hours.For best results, fix colors by ironing.Colors are washable(warm) or dry-cleanable once fixed. you can buy the Zanza Magic Pens here to print. About these cushion covers： Pattern type: Bee CUSHION COVER ONLY, NO PILLOW INSERT. Difficulty : ★★★★★ Nylon Linen cushion covers (cushion insert not included) Size: 45cm x 45cm / 18' x 18' (+/- 3cm) Sleek invisible zipper design Pattern on one side, no print on reverse side Weight: 120g each Ideal for your living room, bed room and home decor Perfect for multiple occasions: Birthday gifts,Christmas, Wedding gifts etc. Machine washable: cold water and dry naturally, becomes softer over time About the material  Nylon Linen is a strong yet soft natural fibre, with excellent breathing characteristics. It is generally suitable for those with skin irritations or allergies. It is highly anti-static, is lightweight, breathable and has excellent cooling properties. Although suitable for outdoor use, this material is not water-proof.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HsKaoCWsL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zanza","source_asin":"B01GFMDSRI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GFMDSRI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GFMDSRI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
