window.products.push({"id":763591,"name":"Vicluke Tufted Pushback Recliner Chair, Modern Linen Accent Chair with Rivet Decoration, Mid-Century Armchair Single Reclining Sofa with Solid Wood Le","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":273.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mLvC7BRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Push Back Recliner - The ergonomically designed high armchair backrest well-support your spine and eases your back and legs. You can find the most comfortable position by simply pushing on armrests and leaning on the backrest. This functional design allows you to lounge in relaxation and comfort and it’s also perfect for napping or sleeping. Ultra Comfy Material - Woven from the premium linen with more grams, selected innovative linen fabric is breathable up to 95%, wear-resistant and gentle on your skin. As a eco-friendly and formaldehyde-free fabric, it safeguards the health of you and your family and can be used for years. The tension point adorned on the adjustable back give an elegant and stylish update to your home decor, and perfectly avoid wrinkles and deformation of interior upholstery. Sturdy & Durability - Our accent chair features the premium padded cushion with thickened sponge, it performs continuous elasticity and comfort and can keep its shape with time. The legs of this armchair are crafted by solid wood, holding up under big pressure and stably supporting the recliner. Anti-slip feet pads keep the use of silent, prevent floor scratches. An integrated footrest will pop put once you want to lounge or lay down to sleep, which is smooth to operate and users-friendly. Dimension & Appearance - Dimensions: 33.5”D x 29”W x 39”H. It features a bright hue adorned with the chic rivet decor, which makes your home effortless chic and classy. Our vintage armchair makes it easy to fit numerous styles like classic, industrial or modern furnishings. The smooth edge and sleek shape designed ergonomically for the health sake and feel incredibly soft to the touch. Easy Assembly & Service - This recliner chair can be assembled easily according to the instruction. We offer a guaranteed 1-year warranty, you can feel free to contact us at any time, we will provide professional customer service within 24 hour. Close your eyes when you are lightly wrapped by our products, enjoying the ultra soft texture in a reclining position and let the wingback recliner to refresh both your mind and body.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mLvC7BRiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vicluke","source_asin":"B09NN1S77Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763591","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NN1S77Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NN1S77Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":763592,"name":"Natural Bamboo Wooden Roll Top Bread Box Kitchen Food Storage (2- Layer Self-assembly or no assembly required)(natural self-assembly)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61faRbckY8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"We are all proud of these 2 bread boxes, one is finished bread box, another one is self-assemble.  Bamboo Bread Box Features:  1.KEEPS BREAD FRESH Tired of wasting your time and money on bread that gets stale, soggy or moldy in seemingly the blink of an eye? This bamboo bread box from Binabamboo’s is a stylish solution that extends the life of most breads by 3 or 4 days. How? Bread has to breathe to remain moist and crispy at the crust, and our bread box traps the perfect amount of humidity inside to stop it from molding or becoming hard as a  rock so quickly. Whether yours is store bought or homemade, you can count on this container to keep it fresh and flavorful for longer!  2.LARGE CAPACITY Many bread boxes only hold 1 small loaf of bread. Measuring 38*25*36cm and with a multi-level design, our bread box is large enough to fit 2 loaves of bread and baked goods ranging from cookies and croissants to donuts and danishes. It’s ideal for a large family and helps to declutter your countertops from other food packages and containers.  3.100% BAMBOO WOOD Thick bamboo wood makes this bread box more durable than most. While other bread boxes uses thin bamboo wood or other materials that are too weak and flimsy, we only use 100% bamboo wood that’s passed our rigorous requirements.  4.STURDY AND STYLISH It means the world to us when our products are welcomed into your home,and as such,we adhere to the highest standards of craftsmanship to deliver a long-lasting product. Our bread box was crafted with care to add rustic beauty to your kitchen decor and comes in a nice box for easy gifting. A screwdriver is included to tighten the screws as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61faRbckY8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Binabamboo","source_asin":"B0817RG46Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763592","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0817RG46Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0817RG46Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
