window.products.push({"id":763718,"name":"Camp Time Roll-A-Stool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MhVpbRjTL._AC_.jpg","description":"May 2013, Roll-a-Stool for Disc Golf has a brand new look. Three layers of 1000 denier polyester mesh in a variety of colors give the Roll-a-Stool a great new \"semi-transparent\" look. Note how the legs are just visible through the new seat which is also breathable, fast-drying and includes a convenient top carry handle for quick-automatic closure. Features Weighs only 23 ounces. 19\"H x15\" triangular stool that is comfy and amazingly strong. It comes with an adjustable shoulder strap with closure buckle and folds to 26.5\" x 3.\" Seat - made of 1000 denier polyester mesh that are arranged at 60 degree angles and welded into a comfortable non-stretch seat that doesn't sag and provides a standard chair-height sitting position. The corners are 8 layers thick where they attach to the legs. Legs - the disc golf Roll-A-Stool legs are made of oversized 1\" diameter tubing which is made up of premium aluminum alloy 5086-H38 that has a tensile strength of 50,000 PSI. Each leg is internally reinforced at its center hinge with a 3\" long 'press fit birch hardwood dowel' providing the strength of steel at half the weight. It has a 250 lb capacity. Specifications: Stool size-19\"H x15\" triangular, Folded Size- 26.5\" x 3\" diameter, Weight- 23 ounces, Capacity- 250 lbs, Frame- 6005A-T6, Adjustable Shoulder Strap and Closure Buckle. Made in the U.S.A. - Camp Time manufacturers all its products in Spokane Valley, WA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MhVpbRjTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Camp Time, Inc.","source_asin":"B00DDY8IAO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DDY8IAO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DDY8IAO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
