window.products.push({"id":763805,"name":"Inflatable Airplane Travel Neck Pillow with Hood - Comfortable & Supportive Cushion - Detachable Hoodie That Features an Eye Cover - Nap Headrest for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S803wX+oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Travelling Is All About Having Fun And Broadening Your Horizons. However, Long Trips Might Prove Very Uncomfortable. If You Have Been Looking For A Way To Rest Comfortably For As Many Hours You Are On The Road, You Have Come To The Right Place! Who doesn’t love travelling? Meeting new people, gaining knowledge, learning about different cultures and having fun! However, travelling requires spending some or lots of time in an airplane, a bus, a train or a car and this can cause discomfort, stiffness and muscle pain. This is where we step in! We present you with the ultimate inflatable travel pillow which is exactly what you need to rest comfortably and enjoy every short and long trip to the fullest. Unique Design That Will Nicely Embrace Your Neck, Supporting Your Head And Allowing You To Maintain Correct Body Posture This top notch travelling neck support cushion is ideal for anyone who wants to enjoy unmatched comfort on any occasion. The special U shape allows the pillow to snuggly wrap around your neck. As a result, your head will be perfectly supported and you will maintain correct body posture effortlessly. No more painful neck, headaches, lower back pain, stiffness and tight muscles. From now on, travelling will be a synonym of comfort and relaxation for you! Block Out The Light And Enjoy A Nap This innovative travel neck pillow features a hoodie that is attached to it with a zipper. The cute hoodie has an eyes cover which is exactly what you need to block out the world and enjoy a restful sleep. This neck support cushion is also lightweight and compact, allowing you to carry it with you anywhere you go. Place Your Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S803wX+oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homable","source_asin":"B074LVC269","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074LVC269","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074LVC269","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
