window.products.push({"id":763886,"name":"CoTa Global Moose Refrigerator Springy Magnets Set of 4 - Assorted Color Cute Wild Life Elk Springy Magnets For Kitchen Fridge Door, Cool Woodland Ani","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HdR48pnhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE MOOSE SPRINGY MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Add an extra touch of forest vibes to your day and display your collection of cute animal novelty magnets! Perfect animal magnet decor can attach to any metallic surface & make it look fun and cool. CoTa Global's Moose Springy Fridge Magnets can hold several notes or pictures at once. Must-have magnetic home and office accessory to use as convenient note holders. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors & wild life animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique decorative springy magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones & post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Includes CoTa Global Assorted Color Set of 4 Moose Springy Fridge Magnets. The collectible magnets are hand painted & feature adorable moose with flexible springy arms & legs. Each moose has a magnet at the end of each spring & main body, giving you total 4 magnets that can move around & hold several notes & pictures. Cute kitchen fridge magnets measure about 7.5 inches. HIGH-QUALITY WILD LIFE ANIMAL SPRINGY MAGNETS – Fun magnets for refrigerator made of premium quality plastic construction, detailed by hand paint, with durable springs & a strong magnet attached to the back of each 3D-shaped moose figure. The magnetic moose figures are connected to durable springs on each of the arms & legs & can move independently, making it easy & convenient to stick different notes, photos & receipts on your fridge. IDEAL USE FOR THE WILD LIFE REFRIGERATOR MAGNETS SET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Moose magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge and an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos and drawings. Perfect set of functional multi-use magnets for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HdR48pnhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B00LWHUEHO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763886","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00LWHUEHO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00LWHUEHO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
