window.products.push({"id":763936,"name":"Micsus Mini Pull String Garlic Onion Ginger Chili Chopper/Manual Food Processor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516F6rjnWuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Quickly chop and mince a wide variety of foods and seasoning in second with a few pull of a cord. The removable ultra-sharp stainless steel blade makes quick work of chopping and prepping your food. Use 5 pulls of the cord for coarse result, 10 or more pulls if you really need it finely minced. Adjust the results with the number of pulls of the cord. Perfect for garlic, onion, ginger, chili, herbs, vegetables, fruits, nuts, and other food items. Quickly wash and rinse for easy clean up. Can double as a storage container for unused chopped foods. ABS Plastic Cover, 304 Stainless Steel Blade, Made of BPA Free Materials","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516F6rjnWuL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Micsus","source_asin":"B08ZJ3YC47","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZJ3YC47","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZJ3YC47","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":763937,"name":"Omega Vertical Slow Masticating Juice Extractor 43 RPM Compact Design with Automatic Pulp Ejection, 150-Watt, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":479.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QBYkxZ1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Omega Vert Model VSJ843RS Juicer low speed 43RPM squeezing juicer system. The motor rotates at 43 revolutions per minute (RPM), approximately 50% the speed of the original vertical masticating (low speed) juicers. The tighter fit tolerance of the new dual-edge auger strains more juice and breaks down fiber to a palatable level for a smoother, nutrient-dense juice. This gentle squeezing action keeps healthy enzymes intact, reduces heat build-up, delays the oxidation process, and increases the juice's shelf life. Squeeze juice from fruits, vegetables, leafy greens, even wheatgrass! Also makes nut milks. Automatic pulp ejection so you can juice continuously. The AUTO-CLEANING system keeps the screen clear, increasing the machines efficiency. After you are finished juicing,the AUTO-CLEANING system minimizes the clean-up process. The vertical design is compact, contemporary, and productive. With the Omega VSJ843RS, form and function combine to give you the highest degree of extraction and the healthiest possible juice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QBYkxZ1+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Omega","source_asin":"B00JMG317C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763937","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JMG317C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JMG317C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
