window.products.push({"id":763946,"name":"Boyd Sleep Salerno Upholstered Platform Bed Frame Mattress Foundation with Headboard, Dual Front Storage Drawers, and Strong Wood Slat Supports: Butto","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":593.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gKGsn2q2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for contemporary and modern bedrooms, the Boyd Sleep Salerno upholstered platform bed frame mattress foundation with headboard is not only stylish, but functional as well. The trendy low-profile design has 3\" of clearance space from floor-to-rail and features a wood frame and a sturdy, durable wooden slat structure with a center support system that can be used for any mattress type. Boyd Sleep's platform bed is constructed from wood that is strong, yet lightweight and long-lasting coupled with a tufted fabric that is soft to the touch. The low-profile bed frame is supported by wooden legs and the headboard. Combine Boyd Sleep's upholstered platform bed frame with your memory foam, latex, or innerspring mattress to add unparalleled support. It will extend the longevity of your mattress by properly supporting your mattress, and ultimately preventing it from sagging. The wooden slats are specifically designed to be spaced evenly across the top of the platform frame to form a solid base for your mattress, insuring even weight distribution throughout while supporting up to 700 lbs. The sturdy center support system is a must-have for today's heavier mattresses and is not typically found in other platform beds. The Boyd Sleep Salerno bed frame also features dual sliding storage drawers at the foot of the bed. The handsome upholstered panel design of the platform bed is a decorative way to give your mattress the extra support it needs. Ships in 1 box to easily fit through doorways, hallways or stairwells. It's compatible with most standard-sized adjustable bed foundations. Use of a box spring is not required (mattress sold separately). Includes a limited 1 year manufacturer .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gKGsn2q2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boyd Sleep","source_asin":"B08JNM32MM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-763946","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JNM32MM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JNM32MM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
